# Everything below is derived from the user's own disc or firmware and is never
# tracked. The pre-commit hook refuses binaries; this list keeps them out of
# the index in the first place.
# Derived game sources, one tree per title. "out-GTA" used to slip past this
# rule: the pattern was anchored and named only the default directory, so a
# second title's lifted code (22 MB of generated C++) showed up as untracked.
/out/
/out-*/
/bin/
/fw/
/keys/
/ref/
/user/
/blackbox/
/build*/
/dlss/
*.elf
*.sprx
*.prx
*.self
*.SELF
*.pkg
*.pup

# Run artefacts: SPU local-store dumps, logs, captures, scratch scripts.
*.ls
gowa.log
trace.bin
frames.bin
/spucap/
*.ppm
/refs
/surface_*.ppm

# Debug artefacts written by the runtime's diagnostic env vars. They are
# regeneration products, not sources.
*.glsl
*.pgm
*.ppm
surface_*.ppm
teximg_*.ppm
glyphsrc_*.raw
snap_*.bin
pair_*.raw
framelog*
